      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "30 项 calc 而不是 sum::(数组字面量) —— 后者要在 op:set 里拼一个含 30 个 ${} 的数组，跨端插值行为无先例；calc 是内置纯方法，已验。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "sum30",
        "value": "$[calc::(${v0}+${v1}+${v2}+${v3}+${v4}+${v5}+${v6}+${v7}+${v8}+${v9}+${v10}+${v11}+${v12}+${v13}+${v14}+${v15}+${v16}+${v17}+${v18}+${v19}+${v20}+${v21}+${v22}+${v23}+${v24}+${v25}+${v26}+${v27}+${v28}+${v29})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "「近 30 天达标了几**天**」≠「记了几**次**」：一天记两次只算一天，没到目标不算。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "days30",
        "value": "$[calc::(${h0}+${h1}+${h2}+${h3}+${h4}+${h5}+${h6}+${h7}+${h8}+${h9}+${h10}+${h11}+${h12}+${h13}+${h14}+${h15}+${h16}+${h17}+${h18}+${h19}+${h20}+${h21}+${h22}+${h23}+${h24}+${h25}+${h26}+${h27}+${h28}+${h29})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "total",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${s.total},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "avgGap",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${s.avgGap},--)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "maxGap",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${s.maxGap},--)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "best",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${s.best},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "has",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(${total},0),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "今天达没达标 —— 0/1，渲染层据此切勾/圈。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "done",
        "value": "${h0}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "todayCnt",
        "value": "${v0}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lastTs",
        "value": "${s.lastTs}"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "从没记过时 lastTs 为空 → 下面几个键在结果里**整个缺席**，渲染层的 findNotEmpty 兜成 `--`。刻意不回落 0：「距上次 0 天」是骗人的（标准 §7 第 3 条）。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lastDayMs",
        "value": "$[parseDate::(formatDate::(${lastTs},yyyy-MM-dd),yyyy-MM-dd)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "见 streak.df 同名键:投影用最后一个**达标日**,alive 才用最后一条**记录**。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "endDayMs",
        "value": "$[parseDate::(formatDate::(findNotEmpty::(${s.streakEnd},${lastTs}),yyyy-MM-dd),yyyy-MM-dd)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "gapDays",
        "value": "$[round::(calc::((${todayMs}-${lastDayMs})/86400000),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_MON",
        "value": [
          "Jan",
          "Feb",
          "Mar",
          "Apr",
          "May",
          "Jun",
          "Jul",
          "Aug",
          "Sep",
          "Oct",
          "Nov",
          "Dec"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lastLbl",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(${lastTs},MM-dd)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${lastTs},__n__),__n__),0,1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "_note": "「lastLbl」按语言出:中文 9月25日 / 英文 Sep 25(doc/overseas-first.md §5,英文不再出现 09-25)。",
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "_m_lastLbl",
            "value": "$[parseNumber::(formatDate::(${lastTs},MM),0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "_d_lastLbl",
            "value": "$[parseNumber::(formatDate::(${lastTs},dd),0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "lastLbl",
            "value": "${_m_lastLbl}月${_d_lastLbl}日"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "if",
          "props": {
            "val": "$[if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),0,1)]"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "_e_lastLbl",
                "value": "$[index::(${_MON},calc::(${_m_lastLbl}-1))]"
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "lastLbl",
                "value": "${_e_lastLbl} ${_d_lastLbl}"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_note": "⚠️ 连续天数**不能写死在 stat 里** —— 它每过一个午夜就会变（昨天达标、今天还没打，连续仍然成立；前天达标就断了）。写时只存 `streakStart`（当前这段的**起始自然日**，不随时间变），读时投影成天数。\n⚠️ `lastTs` 是**最后一条记录**，而 streakStart 串的是**达标日** —— 目标 >1 时两者可能不在同一天（今天打了 1 次没达标）。所以 alive 用 lastDayMs 判「有没有断」会偏松一天，这是刻意的：\n今天打了但没打够，不该立刻宣告断签 —— 今天还没过完。真正的达标判定在 `done`。\n`ge` 对 null 判 false：从没记过 → alive=0 → streak=0，天然自闸。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "alive",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${lastDayMs},calc::(${todayMs}-86400000)),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "streak",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${alive},1),calc::(round::(calc::((${endDayMs}-${s.streakStart})/86400000),0)+1),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "d0Lbl",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(calc::(${todayMs}-7171200000),MM-dd)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "「d0Lbl」按语言出:中文 9月25日 / 英文 Sep 25(doc/overseas-first.md §5,英文不再出现 09-25)。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_m_d0Lbl",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(formatDate::(calc::(${todayMs}-7171200000),MM),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_d_d0Lbl",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(formatDate::(calc::(${todayMs}-7171200000),dd),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "d0Lbl",
        "value": "${_m_d0Lbl}月${_d_d0Lbl}日"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),0,1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "_e_d0Lbl",
            "value": "$[index::(${_MON},calc::(${_m_d0Lbl}-1))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "d0Lbl",
            "value": "${_e_d0Lbl} ${_d_d0Lbl}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_note": "时效锚(card-design-system §3)。⚠️ 与内容日期分开一个键:锚本轮保持 MM-dd 不本地化(doc/overseas-first.md §5 例外,四端 / 全仓锚统一处理),轴标签等内容日期才按语言出。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "atLbl",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(${todayMs},MM-dd)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "d1Lbl",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(${todayMs},MM-dd)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "「d1Lbl」按语言出:中文 9月25日 / 英文 Sep 25(doc/overseas-first.md §5,英文不再出现 09-25)。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_m_d1Lbl",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(formatDate::(${todayMs},MM),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_d_d1Lbl",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(formatDate::(${todayMs},dd),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "d1Lbl",
        "value": "${_m_d1Lbl}月${_d_d1Lbl}日"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),0,1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "_e_d1Lbl",
            "value": "$[index::(${_MON},calc::(${_m_d1Lbl}-1))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "d1Lbl",
            "value": "${_e_d1Lbl} ${_d_d1Lbl}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
